Package: chronicle
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Chronicle Project Team <team@chronicle.local>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Description: Intelligent Host Behaviour Analysis & Activity Monitor
 Chronicle is a Linux-based host behavioral analysis system designed to track
 and evaluate process activity against historical baselines to detect deviations,
 anomalies, and misuse with local-first privacy guarantees.
